@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"

title 

rectangle "BPR" as BPR #FFE0B2
rectangle "CLER" as CLER #FFCC80
rectangle "CV-CLER" as CVCLER #FFB74D
rectangle "ARFusion-Rec" as ARFusion #FF9800

BPR --> CLER : +L_UI
CLER --> CVCLER : +L_CV
CVCLER --> ARFusion : +lambda_u, L_PBD

rectangle "CV-CLER\n评分解耦" as Path1 #BBDEFB
rectangle "ARFusion-Rec\ndual模式" as Path2 #C8E6C9
rectangle "CV-CLER\n评分解耦" as Path3 #FFCDD2

CVCLER --> Path1
ARFusion --> Path2
ARFusion --> Path3

note top of Path1 : 中等密度域\n(e.g., Stravl)\n仅行为打分: e_u . e_i
note top of Path2 : 极稀疏 +\nprofile语义清晰\nlambda_u * s_collab\n+ (1-lambda_u) * s_prof
note top of Path3 : 极稀疏 +\nprofile语义模糊\n如 IntTravel 匿名字段

@enduml
